    "updated_at": "2026-05-02T07:53:52Z",
    "body": "Right I mean that Web Extensions could define some kind of boolean on environment settings object that we can then reference here. We can then also use that in other APIs that need to branch on whether they run in a Web Extensions context. (For additional clarity, this would be a boolean that is not directly exposed to extensions or websites. It's just one of many internal concepts.)",
